function styleData(i){const [a,b]=CFG.stylePairs[i],aa=assetSeries(a,'totalReturn'),bb=assetSeries(b,'totalReturn'),bm=new Map(bb.map(r=>[r.period,r])),pairs=aa.filter(r=>bm.has(r.period)&&r.value>0&&bm.get(r.period).value>0).map(r=>[r,bm.get(r.period)]);if(!pairs.length)return {rows:[],reason:'需要两侧同日期的总收益序列。'};if(pairs.some(([x,y])=>x.currency!==y.currency||x.basis!=='total_return'||y.basis!=='total_return'))return {rows:[],reason:'两侧币种或收益口径不一致，暂不计算。'};const base=pairs[0][0].value/pairs[0][1].value;return {rows:pairs.map(([x,y])=>({period:x.period,value:x.value/y.value/base*100})),reason:'以首个共同日期为100，两侧总收益比值。'}}
function stylePage(){return pageHead('RELATIVE PERFORMANCE','风格与结构比较','十组相对表现，分别观察风格、行业代理和集中度。ETF代理与指数结构差异明确保留。',marketFilter(['ALL','CN','HK','US','JP']))+`<div class="grid-2">${CFG.styles.map((x,i)=>({...x,i})).filter(x=>state.market==='ALL'||x.market===state.market).map(x=>{const d=styleData(x.i);return `<article class="card card-pad"><div class="card-top"><h3>${x.name}</h3>${marketBadge(x.market)}</div><p class="subtitle">${x.pair}</p>${spark(d.rows)}<div class="line-foot"><span>${d.reason}</span><span class="badge ${state.mode==='demo'?'demo':''}">${state.mode==='demo'?'示例':d.rows.length?'已计算':'待序列'}</span></div><div class="filters" style="margin-top:12px">${CFG.stylePairs[x.i].map(id=>`<button class="pill" data-asset="${id}">${assetBy(id).name} ↗</button>`).join('')}</div></article>`}).join('')}</div><div class="explain">相对曲线上升表示分子在区间内相对更强，不表示绝对价格一定上涨，也不自动产生买卖判断。S2、S4、XLY/XLP及日经/TOPIX包含行业或权重差异。</div>`}
function signalPage(){let list=ASSETS.filter(a=>a.type===state.assetType&&(state.market==='ALL'||a.market===state.market)&&(a.name+' '+a.id).toLowerCase().includes(state.signalSearch.toLowerCase()));const groups=CFG.factors.filter(g=>g.dimension===state.factor),fields=groups.flatMap(g=>g.fields.map(f=>f.id));if(state.signalSort!=='name')list.sort((a,b)=>{const va=assetValue(a,state.signalSort),vb=assetValue(b,state.signalSort);return va===null?1:vb===null?-1:vb-va});return pageHead('PRICE · FUNDAMENTALS · VALUE · MOMENTUM','四维信号观察','保留20组核心指标，分别看交易行为、经营兑现、定价要求和相对强弱。维度之间的背离保留，不合成投资总分。',marketFilter(['ALL','CN','HK','US','JP']))+`<div class="chain-tabs">${['量价','基本面','价值','动量'].map(d=>`<button data-factor="${d}" class="${state.factor===d?'active':''}">${d}</button>`).join('')}</div><div class="toolbar"><input type="search" id="signal-search" placeholder="搜索观察对象" aria-label="搜索信号对象" value="${esc(state.signalSearch)}"><div class="filters"><select id="asset-type" aria-label="对象类型">${[['company','公司'],['index','指数'],['etf','ETF代理']].map(([v,n])=>`<option value="${v}" ${state.assetType===v?'selected':''}>${n}</option>`).join('')}</select><select id="signal-sort" aria-label="指标排序"><option value="name">默认顺序</option>${fields.map(f=>`<option value="${f}" ${state.signalSort===f?'selected':''}>${FIELD_META[f].name} 降序</option>`).join('')}</select></div></div>${assetTable(list,fields)}`+section('本维度的计算口径')+`<div class="grid-3">${groups.map(g=>`<article class="card card-pad"><div class="eyebrow">${g.id}</div><h3>${g.name}</h3><p class="card-sub">${g.formula}</p></article>`).join('')}</div><div class="explain">估值按行业适用性解释；排名仅代表定义内样本。排序排除缺失，不把“不适用”处理为0。季度或半年财务指标按披露频率更新。</div>`}
function macroPage(){const mod=CFG.macroModules.find(m=>m.id===state.macroTab);return pageHead('TOP-DOWN OBSERVATION','宏观观察：条件、传导与反证','消费复苏与通胀下行保留独立观察路径，并通过产业链连接公司。中美信用周期是进一步下钻的长期专题。')+`<div class="chain-tabs">${CFG.macroModules.map(m=>`<button data-macro="${m.id}" class="${m.id===mod.id?'active':''}">${m.title}</button>`).join('')}<button data-nav="overview">深入信用周期专题 →</button></div><div class="card card-pad"><div class="card-top"><h2>${mod.question}</h2>${marketBadge(mod.id)}</div><p class="subtitle">${mod.path}</p><div class="filters" style="margin-top:16px">${mod.chains.map(id=>`<button class="pill" data-chain="${id}">传导链 ${id} · ${CFG.chains.find(c=>c.id===id).name}</button>`).join('')}</div></div>`+section('核心宏观与验证序列')+`<div class="grid-3">${mod.metrics.map(id=>metricCard(metricBy(id))).join('')}</div>`+section('利率、汇率与商品参照')+backgroundCards()}
function narrativePage(){const n=CFG.narratives.find(n=>n.id===state.narrative),current=latestThesis(n.id),hist=saved.thesisHistory.filter(x=>x.narrativeId===n.id).slice().reverse();return pageHead('NARRATIVE WORKSPACE','长期叙事工作台','每条命题连接指标、市场和公司，并保留反向证据、失效条件和历史判断。研究状态由你复核，不由合成数据生成。')+`<div class="chain-tabs">${CFG.narratives.map(x=>`<button data-thesis="${x.id}" class="${n.id===x.id?'active':''}">${x.name}</button>`).join('')}</div><div class="card card-pad"><div class="card-top"><div class="eyebrow">${n.type}</div>${thesisBadge(n.id)}</div><h2 style="margin:8px 0 20px">${n.hypothesis}</h2><div class="grid-2"><div class="hypo"><b>支持证据</b>${n.support}</div><div class="hypo counter"><b>反向证据 / 失效观察</b>${n.counter}</div></div><div class="explain">下一验证节点：${n.next}</div><div class="filters"><button class="pill primary" data-note-target="${n.id}">＋ 添加叙事证据</button>${n.chains.map(id=>`<button class="pill" data-chain="${id}">传导链 ${id}</button>`).join('')}${n.id==='N0'?'<button class="pill" data-nav="overview">打开六块信用面板</button>':''}</div></div>`+
 section('关联指标与观察对象')+(n.metrics.length?`<div class="grid-3">${n.metrics.map(id=>metricCard(metricBy(id))).join('')}</div>`:'<div class="explain">这条主线主要通过商品价格、公司价值与经营指标验证；暂不强行绑定通用宏观数值。</div>')+`<div style="margin-top:18px">${assetTable(n.assets.map(id=>assetBy(id)).filter(Boolean),['ret3','revenue','fcfYield','divYield','valuationRank'])}</div>`+
 section('更新研究判断')+`<form id="thesis-form" class="card card-pad"><input name="narrativeId" type="hidden" value="${n.id}"><div class="form-grid"><label class="field">当前状态<select name="status">${['待验证','证据增强','证据混合','证据减弱'].map(x=>`<option ${current?.status===x?'selected':''}>${x}</option>`).join('')}</select></label><label class="field">下次复核日期<input type="date" name="reviewDate" value="${esc(current?.reviewDate||'')}" required></label><label class="field wide">判断依据与失效条件<textarea name="reason" required maxlength="10000" placeholder="写清依据、尚存矛盾，以及什么变化会让你修改判断。">${esc(current?.reason||'')}</textarea></label></div><button class="pill primary" type="submit" style="margin-top:14px">保存判断版本</button></form>`+section('判断版本与证据')+`<div class="grid-2"><div class="card">${hist.length?hist.map(x=>`<article class="evidence-item"><div class="note-meta"><span class="badge">${esc(x.status)}</span><small>${esc(x.created.slice(0,10))}</small></div><p>${esc(x.reason)}</p><small>下次复核 ${esc(x.reviewDate)}${x.demo?' · 演示时记录':''}</small></article>`).join(''):empty('尚未登记判断版本','保存后形成追加历史，不覆盖之前的判断。')}</div>${notesList(saved.notes.filter(x=>x.target===n.id))}</div>`}
const oldCompanyPage=companyPage;
companyPage=function(){let list=ASSETS.filter(c=>c.type==='company'&&(state.market==='ALL'||c.market===state.market)&&(state.companyChain==='ALL'||c.chain===state.companyChain)&&(state.stage==='ALL'||c.stage===state.stage)&&(c.name+' '+c.id).toLowerCase().includes(state.search.toLowerCase()));return pageHead('COMPANY WATCHLIST','公司观察池与对照','保留原有24家核心锚点，补充14家传导链候选。每家公司同时连接四维指标、叙事和信用传导；样本仍待冻结。',marketFilter(['ALL','CN','HK','US']))+`<div class="toolbar"><input id="company-search" type="search" placeholder="搜索公司或证券代码" value="${esc(state.search)}" aria-label="搜索公司"><div class="filters"><select id="company-chain" aria-label="传导链"><option value="ALL">全部传导链</option>${CFG.chains.map(c=>`<option value="${c.id}" ${state.companyChain===c.id?'selected':''}>${c.id} · ${c.name}</option>`).join('')}</select><select id="company-stage" aria-label="节点">${['ALL','上游','中游','下游','金融'].map(s=>`<option value="${s}" ${state.stage===s?'selected':''}>${s==='ALL'?'全部节点':s}</option>`).join('')}</select><span class="badge">${list.length} 家</span></div></div>${assetTable(list,['ret3','excess3','revenue','roic','fcfYield','valuationRank'])}`+section('公司对照：同一口径，分别看四个维度')+`<div class="card card-pad"><div class="filters"><select id="compare-a" aria-label="对照对象一">${CFG.companies.map(c=>`<option value="${c.id}" ${state.compareA===c.id?'selected':''}>${c.name}</option>`).join('')}</select><span class="muted">与</span><select id="compare-b" aria-label="对照对象二">${CFG.companies.map(c=>`<option value="${c.id}" ${state.compareB===c.id?'selected':''}>${c.name}</option>`).join('')}</select></div><div style="margin-top:16px">${assetTable([assetBy(state.compareA),assetBy(state.compareB)],['ma60','revenue','margin','fcfYield','divYield','excess3'])}</div><p class="card-sub">跨行业差异不代表优劣；财报期间和估值锚需逐项核对。此对照不生成投资总分。</p></div>`+distribution()};
function openAsset(id){const a=assetBy(id);if(!a)return;state.drawer={type:'asset',id};const ns=CFG.narratives.filter(n=>n.assets.includes(id)),available=Object.keys(FIELD_META).filter(f=>applicable(a,f)&&((a.type==='background')?f==='level':f!=='level'));openDrawer(`<div class="card-top">${marketBadge(a.market)}<span class="badge">${a.type==='index'?'指数':a.type==='etf'?'ETF代理':a.type==='background'?'背景变量':a.sector}</span></div><h2 style="margin-top:12px">${esc(a.name)}</h2><p class="subtitle mono">${esc(a.id)} · ${state.mode==='demo'?'全部数值为合成演示':'仅展示已核实录入；空值保持待接入'}</p><div class="chart-lg">${spark(assetSeries(id,a.type==='background'?'level':'close'),'var(--blue)',true)}</div>${a.type!=='background'?`<h3>四维状态 · 各自独立</h3><div class="grid-2">${['量价','基本面','价值','动量'].map(d=>`<div class="hypo"><b>${d}</b>${signalState(a,d)}</div>`).join('')}</div><h3>20组指标及多周期字段</h3><div class="table-wrap"><table class="data-table"><thead><tr><th>维度与指标</th><th>数值</th><th>所属日期</th></tr></thead><tbody>${CFG.factors.flatMap(g=>g.fields.map(f=>`<tr><td>${g.dimension} · ${f.name}</td><td>${valueCell(a,f.id)}</td><td class="muted">${freshness(a,f.id)}</td></tr>`)).join('')}</tbody></table></div>`:''}<h3>关联叙事</h3><div class="filters">${ns.map(n=>`<button class="pill" data-thesis="${n.id}">${n.name}</button>`).join('')||'<span class="muted">作为外部参照，暂未绑定独立公司命题。</span>'}</div>${a.type==='company'?`<h3>信用与产业传导</h3><p class="card-sub">${a.chain}链 / ${a.stage} · 候选归属；实际供应关系与业务敞口待验证。</p><div class="filters" style="margin-top:12px"><button class="pill" data-chain="${a.chain}">查看传导链</button><button class="pill" data-company="${esc(a.id)}">资金—经营—偿债表</button><button class="pill" data-note-target="${esc(a.id)}">添加公司证据</button></div>`:''}${state.mode==='real'?`<h3>录入已核实指标</h3><form id="security-form"><input type="hidden" name="assetId" value="${esc(a.id)}"><div class="form-grid"><label class="field wide">指标<select name="field">${available.map(f=>`<option value="${f}">${FIELD_META[f].name}</option>`).join('')}</select></label><label class="field">所属日期<input name="period" type="date" required></label><label class="field">发布日期<input name="publishedAt" type="date" required></label><label class="field">数值<input name="value" type="number" step="any" required></label><label class="field">币种<select name="currency">${['CNY','HKD','USD','JPY','NONE'].map(x=>`<option ${x===({CN:'CNY',HK:'HKD',US:'USD',JP:'JPY'}[a.market]||'NONE')?'selected':''}>${x}</option>`).join('')}</select></label><label class="field wide">收益口径<select name="basis"><option value="not_applicable">非收益指标</option><option value="total_return">总收益</option><option value="price_return">价格收益</option><option value="raw_price">原始价格</option></select></label><label class="field wide">原始来源<input name="sourceUrl" type="url" required placeholder="https://..."></label><label class="field wide">口径说明（至少包含期间、基准或样本）<input name="notes" required maxlength="3000"></label></div><button class="pill primary" type="submit" style="margin-top:15px">保存对象指标</button></form>`:'<div class="explain">演示数值互不代表实际财务关系。回到研究数据模式可录入原始来源核实后的指标。</div>'}`)}
const legacySourcePage=sourcePage;
sourcePage=function(){return pageHead('COMPLETE DATA COVERAGE','数据与来源','宏观序列、证券与背景变量、研究证据分别接入；完整框架不代表数据已自动接通。')+`<div class="import-area"><h3>证券、指数与背景变量</h3><p>已录入 ${saved.securities.length} 条对象指标。支持20组四维指标、价格和总收益序列；相同对象、字段与日期更新时自动保留旧值。</p><div class="filters"><button class="pill primary" id="choose-security-import">导入对象指标</button><button class="pill" id="download-security-template">下载对象数据模板</button><button class="pill" id="download-dictionary">下载完整配置字典</button></div></div><div class="explain">收益字段必须标注价格收益或总收益，风格比值只计算同币种的总收益序列。估值分位、宽度等样本指标需在notes中写明样本与期间。银行等不适用字段拒绝录入。</div>`+legacySourcePage().replace(/<div class="page-head">[\s\S]*?<\/div><div class="filters"><\/div><\/div>/,'')};
function render(){document.getElementById('nav').innerHTML=NAV.map(([id,icon,label])=>`<button data-nav="${id}" class="${state.page===id?'active':''}" ${state.page===id?'aria-current="page"':''}><span class="ico" aria-hidden="true">${icon}</span>${label}</button>`).join('');document.getElementById('crumb').textContent='投研工作台 / '+(NAV.find(n=>n[0]===state.page)?.[2]||'观测面板');document.querySelectorAll('[data-mode]').forEach(b=>{b.classList.toggle('active',b.dataset.mode===state.mode);b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',String(b.dataset.mode===state.mode))});const fn=state.panel&&state.page==='overview'?panelPage:{home:fullOverview,overview,markets:marketPage,styles:stylePage,signals:signalPage,macro:macroPage,narratives:narrativePage,chains:chainPage,companies:companyPage,horizon:horizonPage,evidence:evidencePage,sources:sourcePage}[state.page]||fullOverview;document.getElementById('main').innerHTML=notice()+fn()+`<footer class="footer"><span>投研观察台 V0.3 · 市场 / 四维信号 / 长期叙事 / 信用专题</span><span>日报见独立归档 · 刷新页面读取最新索引</span></footer>`}
function validateSecurities(items){if(!Array.isArray(items)||!items.length||items.length>20000)throw Error('对象指标必须为1至20,000条。');const seen=new Set(),returnFields=['ret1','ret3','ret6','ret12','excess3','mom12_1','riskMomentum'];return items.map((r,i)=>{const a=assetBy(r.assetId),f=FIELD_META[r.field];if(!a||!f)throw Error(`第${i+1}条：未知对象或字段ID。`);if(!applicable(a,r.field))throw Error(`第${i+1}条：此字段不适用于该对象。`);if(!validDate(r.period)||!validDate(r.publishedAt)||r.publishedAt<r.period)throw Error(`第${i+1}条：日期无效或发布日期早于所属日期。`);if(typeof r.value!=='number'||!Number.isFinite(r.value))throw Error(`第${i+1}条：value需为有限数值。`);if(!safeUrl(r.sourceUrl)||typeof r.sourceLabel!=='string'||!r.sourceLabel.trim())throw Error('每条记录需要有效HTTP(S)来源及来源名称。');if(!['USD','CNY','HKD','JPY','NONE'].includes(r.currency))throw Error('currency需为USD/CNY/HKD/JPY/NONE。');if(!['total_return','price_return','raw_price','not_applicable'].includes(r.basis))throw Error('basis收益口径无效。');if(r.field==='totalReturn'&&r.basis!=='total_return')throw Error('总收益序列需标注total_return。');if(returnFields.includes(r.field)&&!['total_return','price_return'].includes(r.basis))throw Error('收益及动量字段需明确收益口径。');if(r.field==='close'&&r.basis!=='raw_price')throw Error('close字段需标注raw_price。');if(['close','totalReturn'].includes(r.field)&&r.value<=0)throw Error('价格和净值必须大于0。');if(['turnoverRank','valuationRank','breadth'].includes(r.field)&&(r.value<0||r.value>100))throw Error('分位或宽度需在0至100之间。');if(['pe','pb'].includes(r.field)&&r.value<=0)throw Error('非正PE或PB不作常规估值展示，请留空并记录不适用原因。');if(r.field==='drawdown'&&(r.value>0||r.value< -100))throw Error('回撤需在-100至0之间。');if(typeof r.notes!=='string'||!r.notes.trim())throw Error('需在notes中说明期间、基准或样本口径。');const k=r.assetId+'|'+r.field+'|'+r.period;if(seen.has(k))throw Error('同批存在重复对象、字段和日期。');seen.add(k);return {assetId:r.assetId,field:r.field,period:r.period,publishedAt:r.publishedAt,value:r.value,currency:r.currency,basis:r.basis,sourceUrl:safeUrl(r.sourceUrl),sourceLabel:r.sourceLabel.slice(0,200),notes:r.notes.slice(0,5000)}})}
function mergeSecurities(rows){const map=new Map(saved.securities.map(x=>[x.assetId+'|'+x.field+'|'+x.period,x]));rows.forEach(r=>{const k=r.assetId+'|'+r.field+'|'+r.period,old=map.get(k);if(old&&JSON.stringify(old)!==JSON.stringify(r))saved.securityRevisions.push({...old,archivedAt:new Date().toISOString()});map.set(k,r)});saved.securities=[...map.values()];persist()}
function securityTemplate(){const id='MSFT';return {schemaVersion:1,kind:'securities',records:[{assetId:'MSFT',field:'ret3',period:'2026-08-31',publishedAt:'2026-09-01',value:null,currency:assetBy(id)?.market==='CN'?'CNY':assetBy(id)?.market==='HK'?'HKD':assetBy(id)?.market==='JP'?'JPY':'USD',basis:'total_return',sourceUrl:'https://填写原始来源',sourceLabel:'填写来源',notes:'请用核实后的日期与数值替换；记录3个月总收益的计算窗口。'}]}}
const legacyBackup=backup;backup=function(){return {...legacyBackup(),securities:saved.securities,securityRevisions:saved.securityRevisions,thesisHistory:saved.thesisHistory}};
function validateExtendedBackup(d){
 const arrays=['securities','securityRevisions','thesisHistory'];for(const key of arrays)if(d[key]!==undefined&&!Array.isArray(d[key]))throw Error('备份中的'+key+'格式无效。');
 const securities=d.securities?.length?validateSecurities(d.securities):[];
 const revisions=(d.securityRevisions||[]).map(r=>{const x=validateSecurities([r])[0];if(typeof r.archivedAt!=='string'||isNaN(Date.parse(r.archivedAt)))throw Error('对象修订时间无效。');return {...x,archivedAt:r.archivedAt}});
 const history=(d.thesisHistory||[]).map(x=>{if(!x||typeof x.id!=='string'||!CFG.narratives.some(n=>n.id===x.narrativeId)||!['待验证','证据增强','证据混合','证据减弱'].includes(x.status)||typeof x.reason!=='string'||!validDate(x.reviewDate)||typeof x.created!=='string'||isNaN(Date.parse(x.created)))throw Error('叙事判断记录无效。');return x});return {securities,revisions,history};
}
function mergeExtendedBackup(x){if(x.securities.length)mergeSecurities(x.securities);saved.securityRevisions=[...new Map([...saved.securityRevisions,...x.revisions].map(r=>[JSON.stringify(r),r])).values()];saved.thesisHistory=[...new Map([...saved.thesisHistory,...x.history].map(r=>[r.id,r])).values()].sort((a,b)=>a.created.localeCompare(b.created));}
const securityInput=document.createElement('input');securityInput.type='file';securityInput.accept='.json,application/json';securityInput.hidden=true;document.body.append(securityInput);
securityInput.addEventListener('change',async e=>{const file=e.target.files[0];if(!file)return;try{if(file.size>10*1024*1024)throw Error('文件超过10MB。');const d=JSON.parse(await file.text());if(d.schemaVersion!==1||d.kind!=='securities')throw Error('请使用对象数据模板。');const rows=validateSecurities(d.records);mergeSecurities(rows);state.mode='real';render();toast(`已导入${rows.length}条对象指标。`)}catch(err){toast('未导入：'+err.message)}e.target.value=''});
document.addEventListener('click',e=>{const b=e.target.closest('button,[data-asset]');if(!b)return;if(b.dataset.asset){openAsset(b.dataset.asset);return}if(b.dataset.factor){state.factor=b.dataset.factor;state.signalSort='name';render();return}if(b.dataset.macro){state.macroTab=b.dataset.macro;navigate('macro');return}if(b.dataset.thesis){state.narrative=b.dataset.thesis;navigate('narratives');return}if(b.id==='choose-security-import')securityInput.click();if(b.id==='download-security-template')download('security-data-template.json',securityTemplate())});
document.addEventListener('change',e=>{const el=e.target;const mapping={'asset-type':'assetType','signal-sort':'signalSort','compare-a':'compareA','compare-b':'compareB'};if(mapping[el.id]){state[mapping[el.id]]=el.value;render()}});
document.addEventListener('input',e=>{if(e.target.id==='signal-search'){const pos=e.target.selectionStart;state.signalSearch=e.target.value;render();const f=document.getElementById('signal-search');f.focus();f.setSelectionRange(pos,pos)}});
document.addEventListener('keydown',e=>{if(['Enter',' '].includes(e.key)&&e.target.matches('tr[data-asset]')){e.preventDefault();e.target.click()}});
document.addEventListener('submit',e=>{const f=e.target;if(!['security-form','thesis-form'].includes(f.id))return;e.preventDefault();const d=Object.fromEntries(new FormData(f));try{if(f.id==='security-form'){mergeSecurities(validateSecurities([{...d,value:d.value===''?null:Number(d.value),sourceLabel:'手工核实记录'}]));render();openAsset(d.assetId);toast('对象指标已保存。')}else{if(!CFG.narratives.some(n=>n.id===d.narrativeId)||!validDate(d.reviewDate)||!d.reason.trim())throw Error('请填写有效复核日期和判断依据。');saved.thesisHistory.push({id:uid(),...d,created:new Date().toISOString(),demo:state.mode==='demo'});persist();render();toast('已追加一个判断版本，旧判断保留。')}}catch(err){toast(err.message)}});

